    },
    {
      "reference_claim_id": "R-REMEDY",
      "statement": "Owners are advised not to drive their vehicles until the repair has been performed.  Mazda will notify owners, and dealers will replace the front passenger air bag inflator with an alternate one, free of charge.   The recall began December 3, 2019.  Owners may contact Mazda customer service at 1-800-222-5500, option 4.  Mazda's number for this recall is 1317F.  Note: This recall supersedes recalls 16V356 and 17V012.",
